atus":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43E80EB8271FA860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220354016:1":{"text":"每隔几天，他都会逼我喝下一罐粘稠的绿色液体，很苦……非常腥臭的味道，连下水道这里的气味都比那东西好。","source_cn":"每隔几天，他都会逼我喝下一罐粘稠的绿色液体，很苦……非...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD79B0D51C52E6251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220354017:0":{"text":"但是，我身上的伤疤，竟然真的一天天好了起来，最后完全消失了。","source_cn":"但是，我身上的伤疤，竟然真的一天天好了起来，最后完全消失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x690FD4813E3B4A0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220354018:0":{"text":"难道他是个好人？","source_cn":"难道他是个好人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3C574EE553DDBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220354019:1":{"text":"如果不是发生了<style=\"stress\">那件事</style>……我也认为他是好人。","source_cn":"如果不是发生了<style=stress>那件事</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81E919B98785496","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220354020:1":{"text":"那天看守都不在，我想逃跑，却不小心被石头砸伤了脚。","source_cn":"那天看守都不在，我想逃跑，却不小心被石头砸伤了脚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95C65A42ACE397A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1220354021:0":{"text":"这时候几只老鼠爬过来，舔我的伤口。它们……好像饿疯了。","source_cn":"这时候几只老鼠爬过来，舔我的伤口。它们……好像饿疯了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D86BAFA0B7D0A12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1220354022:1":{"text":"我好像猜到了……是不是从那时候起，你发现自己可以控制老鼠？","source_cn":"我好像猜到了……是不是从那时候起，你发现自己可以控制老鼠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36428F8EC493378B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1220354023:0":{"text":"是的……在它们的帮助下，我终于逃离了那个可怕的山洞。","source_cn":"是的……在它们的帮助下，我终于逃离了那个可怕的山洞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89FC8FD7DD4251F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1220354024:1":{"text":"在故事里，公主不是常常被小动物保护吗？我以为……自己差点就要成为公主了。","source_cn":"在故事里，公主不是常常被小动物保护吗？我以为……自己差...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3912686627CE4E94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1220354025:0":{"text":"可是回到锈锚港以后，我发现老鼠们越来越大。它们……变成了怪物。","source_cn":"可是回到锈锚港以后，我发现老鼠们越来越大。它们……变成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40DC46D4507E2709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1220354026:1":{"text":"幸好你能够控制这些老鼠，才没有引发更严重的恶果。","source_cn":"幸好你能够控制这些老鼠，才没有引发更严重的恶果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x467EDC747D060B38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1220354027:1":{"text":"——不，不是的！","source_cn":"——不，不是的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D9FBF970EB91998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1220354028:0":{"text":"我发现……吃掉那些老鼠尸体的动物，血肉会像海浪一样翻涌，会长出新的皮毛——它们都变成了可怕的老鼠！而它们根本不听我的话！","source_cn":"我发现……吃掉那些老鼠尸体的动物，血肉会像海浪一样翻涌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB20F4643F961A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1220354029:1":{"text":"你之前喝下的绿色液体……恐怕是一种特殊的魔药。","source_cn":"你之前喝下的绿色液体……恐怕是一种特殊的魔药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB536EC26525372C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1220354030:0":{"text":"书上说，有些亡灵掌握着可怕的魔法，能够改变生物的血肉之躯……没想到是真的……","source_cn":"书上说，有些亡灵掌握着可怕的魔法，能够改变生物的血肉之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30259E8D7F17514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docume